- Story & Context: Young Elias broke into the restricted shipping bay to reclaim a lost transmitter and found himself trapped between two titans, his boots slick with black engine grease while the sirens began their mournful, rhythmic warnings. He didn't find the device, but he found the frequency of the harbor, eventually screaming "I am the iron lung of the tide" into a handheld radio as the security lights swung toward him. The sound of the gate locking echoes in the background of the opening percussion.
